# Line endings: LF in the repository and LF in every working copy, whatever the machine's core.autocrlf says.
# .editorconfig already declares lf and Prettier enforces it; without this, a Windows checkout with the
# default autocrlf=true rewrites every text file to CRLF on disk and the Git Bash hooks stop running.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary art and fonts: never touch the bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
